reply:
I'll use the `flashcard_deck` component for the ten flip cards and a `progress_bar` for the reviewed count. The bar starts at 0 of 10.

<a2ui-json>
[
  {
    "version": "v0.9.1",
    "createSurface": {
      "surfaceId": "vocab-flashcards",
      "catalogId": "https://a2uicatalog.ai/catalog/c-learning.json"
    }
  },
  {
    "version": "v0.9.1",
    "updateComponents": {
      "surfaceId": "vocab-flashcards",
      "components": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "component": "columns",
          "cols": 2,
          "gap": "1.5rem",
          "align": "top",
          "items": [
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "component": "heading",
                  "text": "Spanish Vocabulary Flashcards"
                },
                {
                  "component": "progress_bar",
                  "value": 0,
                  "label": "Cards reviewed",
                  "accent": "#4f46e5",
                  "show_percent": "true",
                  "caption": "0 of 10 cards reviewed"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "component": "flashcard_deck",
                  "accent": "#4f46e5",
                  "label_front": "SPANISH",
                  "label_back": "ENGLISH",
                  "cards": [
                    { "front": "hola", "back": "hello" },
                    { "front": "gracias", "back": "thank you" },
                    { "front": "por favor", "back": "please" },
                    { "front": "agua", "back": "water" },
                    { "front": "casa", "back": "house" },
                    { "front": "libro", "back": "book" },
                    { "front": "comer", "back": "to eat" },
                    { "front": "amigo", "back": "friend" },
                    { "front": "grande", "back": "big" },
                    { "front": "tiempo", "back": "time / weather" }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
]
</a2ui-json>

The deck flips each card to reveal its English meaning. The progress bar starts at 0%. To update it as cards are reviewed, send a new `updateComponents` message with the same `root` id and a higher `value` and `caption`.
